{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:0.2", "PA_ja_213:0.3"], "en": "The Second Book of Pairs (Dukanipāta), Chapter on the Bīraṇa-Stalks (Bīraṇathambhavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:0.4"], "en": "3. The Bharu Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:1.1", "PA_ja_213:1.2"], "en": "“I have heard, O Bharu King, that you acted as an intermediary between the seers.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:1.3"], "en": "He was cut down along with his kingdom;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:1.4"], "en": "together with the king, he perished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:2.1"], "en": "Therefore, indeed, [one should avoid] going according to desire.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:2.2"], "en": "The wise do not praise [him];", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:2.3"], "en": "one should speak with a mind free from malice,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:2.4"], "en": "uttering speech endowed with truth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_213:3.1"], "en": "The Third Jātaka: The Story of Bharu.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
